function LenderApp({ page, setPage, setMode, openDoor }: { page: LenderPage; setPage: (p: LenderPage) => void; setMode: (m: DemoMode) => void; openDoor: (code: string) => void }) {
  const [inviteOpen, setInviteOpen] = useState(false); if (page === "start") return <div className="consumer-app"><LoStartPage done={() => setPage("link")} /></div>; return <div className="lender-app"><LenderSidebar page={page} setPage={setPage} setMode={setMode} /><div className="lender-main"><LenderHeader />{page === "link" && <YourLinkPage openInvite={() => setInviteOpen(true)} openFeed={() => setPage("borrowers")} previewConsumer={() => openDoor("summit-jlee")} />}{page === "partners" && <PartnersPage previewDoor={openDoor} />}{page === "overview" && <LenderOverview setPage={setPage} openInvite={() => setInviteOpen(true)} />}{page === "borrowers" && <StatusFeedPage openInvite={() => setInviteOpen(true)} onSelect={() => setPage("borrower")} />}{page === "borrower" && <BorrowerDetail setPage={setPage} />}{page === "campaigns" && <JourneysPage />}{page === "organization" && <OrganizationPage openInvite={() => setInviteOpen(true)} />}</div>{inviteOpen && <InviteConsumerModal close={() => setInviteOpen(false)} openConsumer={() => openDoor("invite")} />}</div>;
}

function IntegrationHub({ setMode }: { setMode: (m: DemoMode) => void }) {
  const [connected, setConnected] = useState([true, true, true, false, false, false]); const platforms = [["Total Expert", "TE", "CRM · Customer engagement", "Contacts, Journeys, tasks and milestone events", "te"], ["Blend", "B", "Digital lending · POS", "Application handoff and return-to-lender flow", "blend"], ["Encompass", "E", "LOS · System of record", "Loan milestones and Protect Mode automation", "enc"], ["Shape", "S", "Mortgage CRM", "Lead stages, attribution and automated follow-up", "shape"], ["Salesforce", "SF", "Enterprise CRM", "Custom objects, workflows and analytics", "sf"], ["LenderHomePage", "LH", "Websites · POS", "Embedded acquisition and LO assignment", "lh"]];
  return <div className="integration-hub"><aside className="integration-side"><div className="lender-sidebar-logo"><BrandMark inverse /><span>INTEGRATION HUB</span></div><nav>{[["⌘", "Connections"], ["⌁", "API credentials"], ["↗", "Webhooks"], ["⇄", "Data mapping"], ["▥", "Audit log"]].map((x, i) => <button key={x[1]} className={i === 0 ? "active" : ""} onClick={() => { if (!i) return; const el = document.querySelector(i === 2 ? ".status-object-section" : i === 1 ? ".status-object-section" : ".event-stream"); el ? el.scrollIntoView({ behavior: "smooth" }) : alert(`${x[1]} would open here.`); }}><i>{x[0]}</i>{x[1]}</button>)}</nav><div className="integration-back"><button onClick={() => setMode("lender")}>← Lender workspace</button><span>Production concept · v1.0</span></div></aside><main className="integration-main"><header className="integration-header"><div><span className="section-kicker light">READYIQ ENTERPRISE</span><h1>One readiness network.<br /><em>Every mortgage system.</em></h1><p>ReadyIQ lives independently, presents natively and moves permissioned milestones wherever your teams already work.</p></div><div className="api-status-card"><span className="live-indicator">● All systems operational</span><div><small>API requests · 24h</small><strong>—</strong></div><p><span>Sample environment</span></p></div></header><section className="architecture-strip">{[["01", "◎", "Mortgage entry point", "Website · CRM · POS"], ["02", "R", "ReadyIQ orchestration", "Identity · consent · journeys"], ["03", "IQ", "IDIQ product engine", "Check · build · dispute · report"], ["04", "↗", "Return to lender", "Milestones · review · conversion"]].map((x, i) => <span className="arch-fragment" key={x[0]}><div className={i === 1 ? "core" : ""}><span>{x[0]}</span><i>{x[1]}</i><strong>{x[2]}</strong><small>{x[3]}</small></div>{i < 3 && <b>{i === 2 ? "⇄" : "→"}</b>}</span>)}</section><StatusObjectSection /><section className="connections-section"><div className="integration-section-title"><div><span className="section-kicker light">CONNECTED ECOSYSTEM</span><h2>Platform connections</h2></div><button onClick={() => alert("Connection catalog would open here.")}>＋ Add connection</button></div><div className="connection-grid">{platforms.map((x, i) => <article key={x[0]}><div className="connection-top"><span className={`platform-mark ${x[4]}`}>{x[1]}</span><span className={connected[i] ? "connection-status connected" : "connection-status"}>● {connected[i] ? "Connected" : "Available"}</span></div><h3>{x[0]}</h3><small>{x[2]}</small><p>{x[3]}</p><div className="connection-meta"><span>{connected[i] ? `${i + 3} active mappings` : "Ready to configure"}</span><b>REST · Webhooks</b></div><button className={connected[i] ? "manage" : "connect"} onClick={() => setConnected(connected.map((v, n) => n === i ? !v : v))}>{connected[i] ? "Manage connection" : "Connect platform"} →</button></article>)}</div></section><section className="event-stream"><div className="integration-section-title"><div><span className="section-kicker light">LIVE EVENT STREAM</span><h2>Readiness data in motion</h2></div><span className="stream-live"><i />Listening</span></div><div className="event-table"><div className="event-head"><span>Time</span><span>Source</span><span>Event</span><span>Destination</span><span>Status</span></div>{events.map(x => <div key={x[0]}><span>{x[0]}</span><span><i className="system-dot" />{x[1]}</span><code>{x[2]}</code><span>{x[3]}</span><span className="delivered">✓ {x[4]}</span></div>)}</div></section></main></div>;
}

export default function Home() {
  const __q = typeof location !== "undefined" ? new URLSearchParams(location.search) : new URLSearchParams(); const [mode, setMode] = useState<DemoMode>((__q.get("mode") as DemoMode) || "marketing"); const [consumerPage, setConsumerPage] = useState<ConsumerPage>((__q.get("cpage") as ConsumerPage) || "welcome"); const [lenderPage, setLenderPage] = useState<LenderPage>((__q.get("lpage") as LenderPage) || "link"); const [door, setDoor] = useState<string>(__q.get("c") || (__q.get("mode") === "consumer" ? "invite" : "public")); const __c0 = __q.get("c"); useEffect(() => { if (__c0 && !__q.get("mode")) { setConsumerPage("welcome"); setMode("consumer"); } }, []);
  const openDoor = (code: string) => { setDoor(code); setConsumerPage("welcome"); setMode("consumer"); };
  useEffect(() => { if (window.location.hash) window.history.replaceState(null, "", window.location.pathname); window.scrollTo({ top: 0, behavior: "auto" }); }, [mode, consumerPage, lenderPage]);
  const reset = () => { setMode("marketing"); setConsumerPage("welcome"); setLenderPage("link"); setDoor("public"); };
  const view = useMemo(() => mode === "marketing" ? <ReadyIQWebsite openOrganization={() => setMode("lender")} openStart={() => { setLenderPage("start"); setMode("lender"); }} openConsumer={(page = "welcome") => { if (page === "welcome") setDoor("invite"); setConsumerPage(page); setMode("consumer"); }} openIntegrations={() => setMode("integrations")} /> : mode === "integrations" ? <IntegrationHub setMode={setMode} /> : mode === "lender" ? <LenderApp page={lenderPage} setPage={setLenderPage} setMode={setMode} openDoor={openDoor} /> : consumerPage === "welcome" ? <LenderWebsite door={resolveLink(door)} onStart={() => setConsumerPage("consent")} /> : <ConsumerApp page={consumerPage} setPage={setConsumerPage} onExit={() => setConsumerPage("welcome")} />, [mode, consumerPage, lenderPage, door]);
  return <main><DemoToolbar mode={mode} setMode={setMode} reset={reset} /><div className="demo-canvas">{view}</div></main>;
}
